  "notes": "Per inclusion: requires the box 1 the inclusion names (stale-target join) and the five counts, and publishes one reason for every inclusion. none only when the financing count is 1, both answers are yes, and no financing cannot-tell or withdrawal is current for the borrowing. A missing answer is named missing. A denied financing does not block."
